 ission open\, which is recorded for regular papers only. Size is an edito
 rial estimate.\nScope: Neuromorphic and brain-inspired computing at the i
 ntersection of neuroscience\, algorithms and hardware. Characteristic wor
 k includes spiking neural networks\, learning in neural systems\, event-d
